    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1523">

                <pb facs="1144" n="1028" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg1028"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.404/99.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Vice Consul Stadden to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Manzanillo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-09-29">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 29, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The military authorities in Colima have confiscated Catholic church, orphan
                    asylum, colleges, and have given fifteen days for the bishop to evacuate his
                    palace. These desecrations of church property are causing great indignation.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stadden</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
